    "title": "School, library offering flu, coronavirus shots",
    "text": "There will be flu clinics from 4-7 p.m. Friday, Oct. 17, at Melrose School, 76 Melrose Ave., and 10 a.m. to 1 p.m. Saturday, Oct. 18, at the library, 26 North Road.\nBoth clinics, eligible for everyone at least 3 years old, will offer vaccinations against both the flu and COVID-19.\nFor the school clinic, people should bring their insurance cards. Those who are uninsured, however, will not be turned away. Register through schoolflu.com.\nRegistration for the library clinic, sponsored by the Friends of the Jamestown Philomenian Library, is through twc.thewellcomp.com using “library1018” as the login ID.",
